# Trisilva identity map for git reporting.
#
# Canonicalises every author to their @trisilva.ai identity so that
# `git shortlog`, `git log` and blame attribute work to one person.
# It changes reporting only, never history.
#
# Source of truth: trisilva-os/.memory/reference_identity_map.md
# Regenerate from that file when anyone joins or changes address.
#
# NOTE: "Michael Bui <mf.michaelbui@gmail.com>" is mapped to Bui Le Minh on
# circumstantial evidence (surname, mf. prefix, insureflow ownership) and is
# NOT yet confirmed with Minh. Verify before relying on any metric built on it.

